$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 8S,14R,20R-Tris(tert-butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-10S-hydroxy-7S,13S,15S,21R-tetramethyl-22S-(1S-methylpent-2Z-enyl)-oxacyclodocosa-3Z,5E,11Z-trien-2-one
(51a). Inside a glove box, CrCl2 (28 mg, 0.227 mmol), NiCl2(dppf) (2 mg,
0.003 mmol) and 4,4’-Di-tert-butyl-2,2’-dipyridyl (60 mg, 0.227 mmol)
were transferred into a 50 mL dry round-bottom flask. Dry and
deoxygenated THF (10 mL) was added and the mixture was stirred at rt
until a dark green homogeneous solution formed (about 2 h). The
azeotropically dried (3 × 3 mL of dry toluene) aldehyde 52a (0.015 g,
0.015 mmol) was dissolved in anhydrous, deoxygenated THF (5 mL) and this
solution transferred into the flask containing the catalysts mixture.
After the reaction mixture was stirred at rt for 5 days, it was quenched
with a 1 M solution of sodium serinate (15 mL, prepared from sodium
bicarbonate and d,l-serine) and stirred for another hour. The organic
layer was collected and the aqueous layer extracted with EtOAc (3 × 15
mL). The combined organic layers were dried over MgSO4, filtered and the
solvent removed. Purification by preparative TLC (8:1 hexanes/EtOAc). The
titled compound 51a (0.0069 g, 53.4%) as a light yellow oil. [α]25 D
-126.9 (c 0.29, CHCl3); 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.22 (dd, J = 15.0,
10.8 Hz, 1H), 6.48 (t, J = 11.1 Hz, 1H), 6.11 (dd, J = 15.6, 6.6 Hz, 1H),
5.66 (t, J = 10.5 Hz, 1H), 5.52 (d, J = 11.4 Hz, 1H), 5.34-5.26 (m, 2H),
5.24-5.21 (m, 2H), 4.61 (t, J = 9.6 Hz, 1H), 3.94-3.92 (m, 1H), 3.44-3.42
(m, 2H), 2.80 (td, J = 15.9, 6.6 Hz, 1H), 2.64 (td, J = 12.9, 6.6 Hz,
1H), 2.58-2.53 (m, 1H), 2.10-2.05 (m, 1H), 2.03-1.98 (m, 1H), 1.95(t, J =
6.5 Hz, 1H), 1.73 (s, 1H), 1.54-1.46 (m, 2H), 1.42-1.39 (m, 2H),
1.37-1.32 (m, 2H), 1.16-1.08 (m, 4H), 1.05 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 3H), 1.01 (d,
J = 7.2 Hz, 3H), 0.99 (d, J = 6.6 Hz, 3H), 0.97 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 3H), 0.95
(s, 9H), 0.93 (t, J = 7.0 Hz, 3H), 0.93 (s, 9H), 0.92 (s, 9H), 0.75 (d, J
= 6.6 Hz, 3H), 0.14 (s, 6H), 0.04 (s, 3H), 0.04 (s, 3H), 0.03 (s, 3H),
0.03 (s, 3H) ppm; 13C NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3) δ 166.0, 145.5, 143.5, 133.3,
131.7, 131.5, 130.6, 127.3, 117.6, 79.9, 75.9, 74.5, 72.6, 64.5, 42.4,
40.1, 39.8, 39.4, 35.2, 35.0, 32.4, 32.1, 28.4, 27.1, 26.1, 26.0, 25.9,
20.7, 20.6, 18.4, 18.1, 18.0, 18.0, 16.0, 15.7, 14.4, 11.3, -3.8, -4.2,
-4.3, -4.4, -4.5, -4.8 ppm; HRMS (ESI) calcd for C49H94O6Si3Na [M + Na]+
885.6250, found 885.6228.
