$DATUM 7732-18-5
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
8S,14R,20R-Tris(tert-butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-10S-hydroxy-7S,13S,15S,21R-tetramethyl-22S-(1S-methylpent-2Z-enyl)-oxacyclodocosa-3Z,5E,11Z-trien-2-one
(51a). Inside a glove box, CrCl2 (28 mg, 0.227 mmol), NiCl2(dppf) (2 mg,
0.003 mmol) and 4,4’-Di-tert-butyl-2,2’-dipyridyl (60 mg, 0.227 mmol)
were transferred into a 50 mL dry round-bottom flask. Dry and
deoxygenated THF (10 mL) was added and the mixture was stirred at rt
until a dark green homogeneous solution formed (about 2 h). The
azeotropically dried (3 × 3 mL of dry toluene) aldehyde 52a (0.015 g,
0.015 mmol) was dissolved in anhydrous, deoxygenated THF (5 mL) and this
solution transferred into the flask containing the catalysts mixture.
After the reaction mixture was stirred at rt for 5 days, it was quenched
with a 1 M solution of sodium serinate (15 mL, prepared from sodium
bicarbonate and d,l-serine) and stirred for another hour. The organic
layer was collected and the aqueous layer extracted with EtOAc (3 × 15
mL). The combined organic layers were dried over MgSO4, filtered and the
solvent removed. Purification by preparative TLC (8:1 hexanes/EtOAc).
8S,14R,30R-Tris-(tert-butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-10S-hydroxy-7R,13S,15S,21R-tetramethyl-22S-(1S-methylpent-2Z-enyl)-oxacyclodocosa-3Z,5E,11Z-trien-2-one
(51b). Following the same procedure utilized for the synthesis of 51a,
CrCl2 (192 mg, 1.57 mmol), NiCl2(dppf) (14 mg, 0.02 mmol) and
4,4’-Di-tert-butyl-2,2’-dipyridyl (423 mg, 1.57 mmol) were dissolved in
freshly distilled and degassed THF (100 mL). After the solution turned
green a solution of aldehyde 52b (104 mg, 0.105 mmol) in dry, degassed
THF (5 mL) was added dropwise via syringe and the resulting reaction
mixture stirred at rt for 4 days. After work-up and purification via
preparative TLC (9:1 hexanes/EtOAc, 2×) the desired product 51b (20.3 mg,
22%) was obtained as a light-yellow oil. TLC Rf = 0.44 (5:1
hexanes/EtOAc); [α]25 D -62.1 (c 0.68, CH2Cl2); 1H (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ
7.21 (dd, J = 15.0, 11.6 Hz, 1H), 6.50 (t, J = 11.3 Hz, 1H), 6.03 (dd, J
= 15.4, 7.0 Hz, 1H), 5.64 (t, J = 10.4 Hz, 1H), 5.54 (d, J = 11.3 Hz,
1H), 5.32 (ddd, J= 10.9, 7.1, 7.1 Hz, 1H), 5.29-5.21 (m, 2H), 5.14 (dd, J
= 7.7, 2.6 Hz, 1H), 4.57 (t, J = 8.8 Hz, 1H), 4.03 (d, J = 10.2 Hz, 1H),
3.45 (bs, 1H), 3.40 (d, J = 2.6 Hz, 1H), 2.81 (dd, J = 16.0, 7.8 Hz, 1H),
