$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Iodoalkene (2). A slurry of CrCl2 (49 mg, 0.40 mmol) in dry THF (2 mL)
was stirred at room temperature for 15 min. The reaction was cooled to 0
°C. A solution of aldehyde 23 (32 mg, 0.06 mmol) and iodoform (53 mg,
0.13 mmol) in THF (1 mL) were added. The resulting reddish-brown mixture
was stirred for 6 h. The reaction mixture was diluted with water, and
extracted with ether. The organic layer was washed with sat. sodium
thiosulphate, and dried over MgSO4. The removal of solvent under reduced
pressure and purification by silica gel flash column chromatography (10%
ethyl acetate/hexane) afforded the (E)-iodoalkene 2 (26.2 mg, 65%) and
(Z)-iodoalkene 2'(8.6 mg, 21%) as colorless oils. (E)-Iodoalkene
2;[α]D24-10.9 (c 0.5 CHCl3); Rf (20% EtOAc/hexane) = 0.30; IR (film,
cm-1) 2928, 1770, 1724, 1460, 1366, 1255, 1199, 756; 1H-NMR (500 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 7.31 (t, J= 8.0 Hz, 1H), 7.05 (dd, J= 6.5, 5.5 Hz, 2H), 6.55
(dtd, J= 14.5, 7.5, 7.0 Hz, 1H), 6.21 (dt, J= 14.5, 1.5 Hz, 1H), 5.61 (m,
1H), 4.34 (td, J= 9.5, 3.5 Hz, 1H), 4.05 (m, 1H), 3.91 (m, 1H), 3.61 (dd,
J= 14.5, 11.0 Hz, 1H), 2.42 (m, 2H), 2.34 (m, 1H), 2.30 (s, 3H), 1.91 (m,
1H), 1.76 (m, 1H), 1.62 (m, 2H), 1.50 (m, 2H), 0.90 (s, 9H), 0.05 (s,
6H); 13C-NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 168.7, 168.1, 146.5, 140.9, 139.7, 129.8,
128.8, 127.8, 120.5, 77.9, 73.9, 72.4, 65.2, 65.0, 40.9, 39.7, 39.5,
38.6, 37.6, 31.5, 25.7, 22.6, 21.4, 17.9, 14.0,-4.8; EI-HRMS m/z:
600.1395 (Calcd for C26H37IO6Si: 600.1404), EI-MS m/z: 600 (M+) 543, 525,
501, 483, 468, 409, 391, 363, 349, 341, 323, 307, 289, 281, 263, 251,
235, 219, 205, 187, 176, 163, 147, 134, 115, 105, 94, 81, 73, 67,
57.Z-iodoalkene 2': [α]D24+26.6 (c 0.2 CHCl3); Rf (20% EtOAc/hexane) =
0.35; IR (CHCl3 film, cm-1) 2927, 1771, 1725, 1459, 1365, 1254, 1199,
836, 735; 1H-NMR (270 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.31 (t, J= 7.8 Hz, 1H), 7.06 (d, J=
3.5 Hz, 1H), 7.03 (dd, J= 4.5, 1.1 Hz, 1H), 6.40 (dt, J= 7.5, 1.3 Hz,
1H), 6.31 (dt, J= 7.5, 6.4 Hz, 1H), 5.69 (m, 1H), 4.34 (td, J= 9.4, 3.7
Hz, 1H), 4.04 (m, 1H), 3.92 (m, 1H), 3.58 (dd, J= 14.3, 10.8 Hz, 1H),
2.47 (m, 3H), 2.23 (s, 3H), 1.83 (m, 2H), 1.60 (m, 4H) 0.90 (s, 9H), 0.05
(s, 6H); 13C-NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ 168.6, 168.0, 146.5, 139.7, 136.4,
129.8, 128.8, 127.8, 120.5, 85.3, 73.8, 72.5, 65.5, 65.4, 40.0, 39.6,
39.2, 38.8, 37.8, 25.7, 20.9, 17.9, -4.8; FAB-HRMS m/z: 623.1306 (Calcd
for C26H37IO6SiNa: 623.1302), FAB-MS m/z: 623 (M+ +Na), 621, 599, 497,
495, 427, 409, 363, 321, 273, 231, 205, 163, 135, 73, 59, 23.
