$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of Oxazolomycin A through the Union of Three Segments.
Nozaki-Hiyama-Kishi Coupling of 17 and 4. To a mixture of NiCl2 (6.34 mg,
0.049 mmol) and CrCl2 (240 mg, 1.96 mmol) in degassed THF-DMSO (3:1, 6.0
mL) were added a solution of 17 (301 mg, 0.49 mmol) in degassed THF-DMSO
(3:1, 2.0 mL) and 4 (381 mg, 0.98 mmol). After stirring at rt for 13 h,
the reaction was quenched with H2O (3.0 mL) at 0 °C and the mixture was
filtered through Celite. The filtrate was extracted with AcOEt, dried,
concentrated, and purified by flash column chromatography (SiO2 20 g,
hexane:AcOEt = 8:1 to 3.5:1 to 1:1) to give a 3:2 mixture of 29 and its
7S-epimer (364 mg, 81%) as a colorless oil. Compound 29: 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 7.77 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 2H), 7.60 (d, J = 7.3 Hz, 2H), 7.40 (t, J =
7.6 Hz, 2H), 7.31 (t, J = 7.3 Hz, 2H), 6.25-6.13 (m, 2H), 5.71-5.66 (m,
2H), 5.51 (d, J = 3.9 Hz, 1H), 5.43 (d, J = 3.9 Hz, 1H), 4.89 (brs, 1H),
4.75 (d, J = 12.9, 1H), 4.42 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 2H), 4.22 (t, J = 6.8 Hz,
1H), 4.15 (d, J = 12.9 Hz, 1H), 3.99 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 1H), 3.87 (brs, 2H),
3.45 (dd, J = 3.4, 7.6 Hz, 1H), 3.32 (s, 3H), 2.79- 2.74 (m, 4H),
2.15-2.09 (m, 1H), 1.87-1.76 (m, 2H), 1.12 (d, J = 7.3 Hz, 3H), 1.19-0.79
(m, 39H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 176.5, 169.0, 156.2, 143.9, 141.2,
134.0, 131.1, 130.9, 129.8, 127.6, 127.0, 125.0, 119.9, 85.4, 85.0, 83.4,
72.1, 61.0, 58.7, 47.2, 43.1, 42.6, 36.9, 33.0, 25.8, 17.6, 17.0, 16.9,
16.8, 16.7, 16.4, 13.3, 11.7, 8.1; FTIR (neat) 3418, 3332, 1722, 1693,
1464, 1246 cm-1; HRMS (FAB) calcd for C50H77N2O 10Si2[(M+1)+] 921.5116,
found: 921.5112. 7S-epimer: [α]25D + 29.4 (c 0.65, CHCl3); 1H NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.77 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H), 7.60 (d, J = 7.3 Hz, 2H), 7.40
(t, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H), 7.31 (t, J = 7.3 Hz, 2H), 6.26-6.14 (m, 2H),
5.74-5.69 (m, 2H), 5.52 (d, J = 3.9 Hz, 1H), 5.43 (d, J = 3.9 Hz, 1H),
4.91 (brs, 1H), 4.76 (d, J = 12.9, 1H), 4.42 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 2H),
4.22-4.15 (m, 3H), 3.87 (t, J = 5.7 Hz, 2H), 3.40 (dd, J = 3.6, 7.4 Hz,
1H), 3.31 (s, 3H), 2.79 (s, 3H), 2.75 (q, J = 7.1 Hz, 4H), 2.19-2.16 (m,
1H), 1.81-1.75 (m, 1H), 1.57-1.50 (m, 1H), 1.12 (d, J = 7.1 Hz, 3H),
1.19-0.81 (m, 39H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 176.1, 169.0, 156.2,
143.9, 141.3, 134.7, 131.1, 130.0, 129.7, 127.7, 127.0, 125.0, 119.9,
85.5, 85.1, 83.4, 72.2, 61.0, 58.8, 47.3, 43.2, 36.5, 32.7, 25.8, 17.7,
17.0, 16.9, 16.8, 13.8, 13.4, 11.8, 8.2; FTIR (neat) 3414, 3330, 1729,
1692, 1523, 1463, 1390, 1246 cm-1; HRMS (FAB) calcd for C50H 77N2O10Si2
[(M+1)+] 921.5116, found: 921.5112.
