$DATUM Allyl alcohol (19) and (19'). To a solution of aldehyde 9 (320 mg, 0.94
mmol) and iodoalkene 8 (422 mg, 1.03 mmol) in dry degassed DMSO (10 mL)
was added CrCl2 containing 0.1% NiCl2 (462 mg, 3.76 mmol) at room
temperature. The resulting dark green mixture was stirred at room
temperature for 20 h. The reaction mixture was quenched with saturated
NH4Cl (10 mL) and extracted with ethyl acetate (2 × 30). The combined
extract was washed with brine, and dried over MgSO4. The removal of
solvent and purification of crude product by medium pressure silica gel
column chromatography eluting with 30-35% ethyl acetate/hexane provided
the desired isomer 19 (250 mg, 43%) and undesired isomer 19' (189 mg,
32%) as colorless oils. Desired isomer 19; [α]D24-3.8 (c 0.5 CHCl3); Rf
(40% EtOAc/hexane) = 0.40; IR (film, cm-1) 3458, 2946, 1729, 1582, 1267,
1112, 698; 1H-NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.31 (m, 16H), 6.82 (d, J=7.8 Hz,
1H), 6.80 (d, J=8.1 Hz, 1H), 5.78 (dtd, J= 17.5, 6.7, 1.2 Hz, 1H), 5.54
(ddt, J= 15.6, 6.9, 1.3 Hz, 1H), 5.50 (s, 1H), 5.08 (s, 2H), 5.50 (dd, J=
14.4, 12.0 Hz, 2H), 4.38 (br, s, 1H), 4.04 (m, 2H), 3.86 (s, 3H), 3.68
(m, 1H), 3.56 (m, 1H), 3.35 (d, J= 6.6 Hz, 2H), 2.82 (s, 1H), 1.90 (m,
3H), 1.65 (m, 2H), 1.48 (m, 1H); 13C-NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 168.4, 155.5,
138.7, 138.4, 138.3, 136.7, 133.9, 130.4, 129.1, 128.6, 128.4, 128.3,
128.1, 127.7, 127.6, 127.5, 126.8, 125.9, 124.0, 121.9, 110.6, 100.4,
76.4, 73.7, 72.9, 71.3, 70.3, 65.8, 52.1, 42.7, 37.0, 36.1, 35.9;
FAB-HRMS m/z: 645.2824 (Calcd for C39H42O7Na: 645.2828), FAB-MS m/z: 645
(M+ +Na), 644, 605, 553, 537, 467, 449, 369, 359, 305, 249, 221, 181,
121, 91, 55, 43.Undesired isomer 19'; [α]D24-7.59 (c 0.5 CHCl3); Rf (40%
EtOAc/hexane) = 0.45; IR (film, cm-1) 3458, 2946, 1729, 1582, 1453, 1267,
1112, 698; 1H-NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.31 (m, 16H), 6.81 (d, J=7.8 Hz,
1H), 6.80 (d, J=8.1 Hz, 1H), 7.79 (dtd, J= 16.5, 6.6, 1.2 Hz, 1H), 5.56
(ddt, J= 15.3, 6.0, 1.2 Hz, 1H), 5.48 (s, 1H), 5.08 (s, 2H), 4.50 (dd, J=
14.7, 12.0 Hz, 2H), 4.42 (br, s, 1H), 4.15 (m, 2H), 3.86 (s, 3H), 3.69
(m, 1H), 3.58 (m, 1H), 3.36 (d, J= 6.6 Hz, 2H), 2.38 (d, J= 4.8 Hz, 1H),
1.89 (m, 3H), 1.71 (m, 1H), 1.54 (m, 2H); 13C-NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ
168.5, 155.6, 138.7, 138.5, 138.4, 136.7, 134.3, 130.4, 128.6, 128.5,
128.4, 128.3, 128.1, 127.7, 127.6, 127.5, 126.8, 125.9, 124.0, 121.9,
110.6, 100.4, 73.9, 73.7, 72.9, 70.3, 65.8, 52.1, 42.3, 36.9, 36.1, 36.0;
FAB-HRMS m/z: 645.2832 (Calcd for C39H42O7Na: 645.2828), FAB-MS m/z: 645
(M+ +Na), 605, 553, 522, 517, 467, 413, 375, 305, 279, 215, 176, 121, 91,
55, 41.
