$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 8R-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-10R-hydroxy-7R,13S,15S,17S,21R-pentamethyl-22S-(1S-methylpenta-2Z,4-dienyl)-14R,20R-bistriethylsilanyloxyoxacyclodocosa-3Z,5E,11Z-trien-2-one
(67). Inside a glove box, CrCl2 (84 mg, 0.690 mmol), NiCl2(dppf) (4.7 mg,
0.0069 mmol) and 4,4’-Di-tert-butyl-2,2’-dipyridyl (184 mg, 0.69 mmol)
were transferred into a 100 mL dry round-bottom flask. Anhydrous,
deoxygenated THF (36 mL) was added and the mixture stirred at rt until a
dark green homogeneous solution formed (about 2 h). The azeotropically
dried (3 × 3 mL of dry toluene) aldehyde 66 (46 mg, 0.046 mmol) was
dissolved in anhydrous, deoxygenated THF (10 mL) and this solution was
transferred into the flask containing the catalysts. After the reaction
mixture was stirred at rt for 5 days, it was quenched with a 1 M solution
of sodium serinate (10 mL, prepared from sodium bicarbonate and
d,l-serine) and stirred for another hour. The organic layer was collected
and the aqueous layer extracted with EtOAc (3 × 25 mL). The combined
organic layers were dried over MgSO4, filtered and the solvent removed
under reduced pressure. Purification by preparative TLC (8:1
hexanes/EtOAc) provided the desired α-alcohol 67 (17.2 mg, ca. 43%) as a
light yellow oil and the less polar C9-epimer 67β (4.8 mg, 12%).
8R-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-10R-hydroxy-7R,13S,15S,17S,21R-pentamethyl-22S-(1S-methylpenta-2Z,4-dienyl)-14R,20R-bistriethylsilanyloxyoxacyclodocosa-3Z,5E,11Z-trien-2-one
(67): 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ 6.59 (dt, J = 16.8, 10.2 Hz, 1H), 6.52
(t, J = 11.1 Hz, 1H), 6.08-6.01 (m, 2H), 5.68-5.65 (m, 1H), 5.58 (d, J =
11.4 Hz, 1H), 5.39-5.33 (m, 2H), 5.20 (d, J = 16.8 Hz, 1H), 5.11 (d, J =
9.6 Hz, 1H), 5.07 (t, J = 6.0 Hz, 1H), 5.01-4.96 (m, 1H), 4.58-4.56 (m,
1H), 4.11-4.08 (m, 1H), 3.51 (bs, 1H), 3.23 (d, J = 6.6 Hz, 1H),
3.04-3.01 (m, 1H), 2.66-2.61 (m, 2H), 1.81-1.78 (m, 1H), 1.73-1.70 (m,
2H), 1.51-1.33 (m, 7H), 1.25-1.22 (m, 3H), 1.20-1.10 (m, 4H),1.07 (d, J =
6.6 Hz, 3H), 1.02 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 3H), 0.99-0.92 (m, 24H), 0.88-0.78 (m,
9H), 0.65-0.58 (m, 12H), 0.14 (s, 3H), 0.11 (s, 3H) ppm; HRMS (ESI) calcd
for C50H94O6Si3Na [M + Na]+ 897.6256, found 897.6262. C9-epimer (67β): 1H
NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ 6.63 (dt, J = 17.4, 10.2 Hz, 1H), 6.54 (t, J =
11.1 Hz, 1H), 6.07-6.02 (m, 2H), 5.54 (d, J = 11.4 Hz, 1H), 5.46 (t, J =
10.5 Hz, 1H), 5.40-5.36 (m, 2H), 5.22 (d, J = 16.8 Hz, 1H), 5.14 (d, J =
10.2 Hz, 1H), 5.06 (br s, 1H), 4.58 (t, J = 8.1 Hz, 1H), 3.96 (bs, 1H),
3.56 (bs, 1H), 3.32 (bs, 1H), 3.08-3.05 (m, 1H), 2.76-2.70 (m, 2H),
1.87-1.84 (m, 2H), 1.70-1.65 (m, 2H), 1.45-1.17 (m, 8H), 1.13 (d, J = 6.6
Hz, 3H), 1.01-0.87 (m, 42H), 0.65-0.61 (m, 12H), 0.09 (s, 6H) ppm.
